---
source: crates/core/tests/visual.rs
expression: "draw_explanation(&explanation, format, &limits()).unwrap()"
---
<style>
.cleanrules{font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:#202124}
.cleanrules .title{font-weight:bold;margin:0 0 8px}
.cleanrules ul.tree,.cleanrules ul.tree ul{list-style:none;margin:0;padding-left:24px}
.cleanrules ul.tree{padding-left:0}
.cleanrules ul.tree ul{border-left:1px solid #dadce0}
.cleanrules li{margin:4px 0}
.cleanrules .node{display:inline-block;border-radius:3px;padding:2px 6px}
.cleanrules .description{white-space:pre-wrap;color:#5f6368;font-style:italic}
.cleanrules .payload{font-style:italic}
.cleanrules table{border-collapse:collapse}
.cleanrules caption{font-weight:bold;text-align:left;margin-bottom:4px}
.cleanrules th,.cleanrules td{border:1px solid #dadce0;padding:2px 6px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top}
.cleanrules .connective{background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #5f6368;border-radius:12px}
.cleanrules .leaf{background:#f8f9fa;border:1px solid #5f6368}
.cleanrules .rule{background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #202124;border-radius:8px}
.cleanrules .rule_selected{background:#e8f0fe;border:2px solid #1a73e8;border-radius:8px}
.cleanrules .rule_fired{background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #1a73e8;border-radius:8px}
.cleanrules .rule_not_fired{background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #5f6368;border-radius:8px}
.cleanrules .rule_unknown{background:#f1f3f4;border:1px dashed #80868b;border-radius:8px}
.cleanrules .truth_true{background:#e6f4ea;border:1px solid #1e8e3e}
.cleanrules .truth_false{background:#fce8e6;border:1px solid #d93025}
.cleanrules .truth_unknown{background:#f1f3f4;border:1px dashed #80868b}
.cleanrules .truth_degree{background:#fef7e0;border:1px solid #f9ab00}
.cleanrules .field{background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #5f6368;border-radius:12px}
.cleanrules .output{background:#f3e8fd;border:1px solid #9334e6}
</style>
<div class="cleanrules cleanrules-explanation">
<p class="title">HIT POLICY priority: selected e</p>
<ul class="tree">
<li><div class="node rule_not_fired" style="background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #5f6368;border-radius:8px"><div class="line">[ ] a (not fired)</div><div class="line">x &gt; 10 AND NOT y &lt;= 3</div></div>
<ul>
<li><div class="node connective" style="background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #5f6368;border-radius:12px"><div class="line">all of</div></div>
<ul>
<li><div class="node truth_false" style="background:#fce8e6;border:1px solid #d93025"><div class="line">x &gt; 10</div><div class="line">false (x = 8)</div><div class="line">short by 2</div></div></li>
<li><div class="node truth_true" style="background:#e6f4ea;border:1px solid #1e8e3e"><div class="line">y &lt;= 3</div><div class="line">true (y = 2), but the rule needs it false</div><div class="line">needs y &gt; 3 (short by 1)</div></div></li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li><div class="node rule_not_fired" style="background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #5f6368;border-radius:8px"><div class="line">[ ] b (not fired)</div><div class="line">x BETWEEN 0 AND 5</div></div>
<ul>
<li><div class="node truth_false" style="background:#fce8e6;border:1px solid #d93025"><div class="line">x &lt;= 5</div><div class="line">false (x = 8)</div><div class="line">over by 3</div></div></li>
</ul>
</li>
<li><div class="node rule_not_fired" style="background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #5f6368;border-radius:8px"><div class="line">[ ] c (not fired)</div><div class="line">x &gt; 1 AND NOT x &gt; 1</div><div class="line">cannot fire by changing these conditions alone; they conflict</div></div>
<ul>
<li><div class="node truth_true" style="background:#e6f4ea;border:1px solid #1e8e3e"><div class="line">x &gt; 1</div><div class="line">true (x = 8), but the rule needs it false</div><div class="line">needs x &lt;= 1 (over by 7)</div></div></li>
</ul>
</li>
<li><div class="node rule_fired" style="background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #1a73e8;border-radius:8px"><div class="line">[x] d (fired, not selected)</div><div class="line">x &gt; 1</div><div class="line">fired, but e has a higher priority (5 &gt; 1)</div></div>
<ul>
<li><div class="node truth_true" style="background:#e6f4ea;border:1px solid #1e8e3e"><div class="line">x &gt; 1</div><div class="line">true (x = 8)</div></div></li>
</ul>
</li>
<li><div class="node rule_selected" style="background:#e8f0fe;border:2px solid #1a73e8;border-radius:8px"><div class="line">[x] e (selected)</div><div class="line">x &gt; 0</div></div>
<ul>
<li><div class="node truth_true" style="background:#e6f4ea;border:1px solid #1e8e3e"><div class="line">x &gt; 0</div><div class="line">true (x = 8)</div></div></li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
</div>
